 and (11) to (14) is DKK 6,810","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11","machineReadableUrl":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2025/1612/xml"},{"id":"fee-order-family","url":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2025/1612","title":"Order No. 1612 of 2025 on fees, § 5(5)(1): for 1 January to 31 December 2026 the fee for a permit application under Aliens Act § 9 m(1) and (2), for family members, is DKK 3,080","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11","machineReadableUrl":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2025/1612/xml"},{"id":"aliens-act-fee","url":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/953","title":"Aliens Act, § 9 h(1)(4) and (9) and (2): a fee is paid no later than with an application under § 9 a(2)(1) to (14) or § 9 m(1); the minister sets the fees","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11","machineReadableUrl":"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/953/xml"},{"id":"siri-processing-and-duration","url":"https://www.nyidanmark.dk/en-GB/You-want-to-apply/Work/Pay-limit-scheme","title":"SIRI, the Pay Limit Scheme: normal processing time 1 month, up to 3 months if more information is needed; a permit for the employment period, normally 4 years at most","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11"}],"countries":{"id":"countries","number":1},"formerCountries":{"id":"former-countries","number":1},"officialDomains":[{"id":"dk","number":1}],"countrySets":[{"id":"eu-free-movement","number":2}],"requirements":[{"id":"not-nordic-eu-eea-or-swiss-citizen","title":"Not a citizen of Denmark, another Nordic country, an EU or EEA state or Switzerland: they live and work in Denmark without this permit","expression":{"op":"not","operand":{"op":"intersects","list":{"op":"fact","key":"principal.citizenships"},"set":{"op":"set","id":"eu-free-movement"}}},"sources":["aliens-act-free-movement","eu-residence-order"]}],"assessments":[{"id":"pay-limit","title":"A job offer in Denmark with annual pay of at least the pay limit: DKK 400,000 in the act, adjusted each year for wage growth; DKK 552,000 for 2026 as SIRI publishes it","evidence":["principal.monthlyActiveIncome"],"sources":["aliens-act-pay-limit","siri-pay-limit"]},{"id":"working-hours","title":"Employment of at least 30 hours a week","evidence":["principal.monthlyActiveIncome"],"sources":["aliens-act-employment-terms","siri-pay-limit"]},{"id":"danish-bank-account","title":"Pay goes into a Danish bank account, opened within 180 days of entry or of the permit by someone who does not yet hold a permit of at least 180 days","evidence":["principal.monthlyActiveIncome"],"sources":["aliens-act-employment-terms","siri-pay-limit"]},{"id":"usual-terms","title":"Pay and employment terms not inferior to the Danish standards of the professional field","evidence":["principal.monthlyActiveIncome"],"sources":["siri-pay-limit"]},{"id":"genuine-offer","title":"No permit for a job covered by a lawful labour dispute, nor where the actual employment is presumed not to match the application or the offer mainly serves to obtain residence","evidence":["principal.monthlyActiveIncome"],"sources":["aliens-act-employment-terms"]},{"id":"no-social-assistance","title":"Neither the principal nor the family members with permits through them receive assistance under the Active Social Policy Act","evidence":["unit.liquidAssets"],"sources":["aliens-act-social-assistance"]},{"id":"shared-home","title":"Family members live at the same address as the principal and receive no assistance under the Active Social Policy Act","evidence":["unit.liquidAssets"],"sources":["aliens-act-family","siri-accompanying-family"]}],"dependents":[{"id":"spouse","title":"Spouse who was 18 or more at the wedding; married younger, both now 18 or more: possible, as a cohabiting partner after at least 1.5 to 2 years living together","path":["spouse"],"condition":{"op":"any","operands":[{"op":"gte","left":{"op":"fact","key":"edge.ageAtStart"},"right":{"op":"int","value":18}},{"op":"all","operands":[{"op":"gte","left":{"op":"fact","key":"person.ageYears"},"right":{"op":"int","value":18}},{"op":"gte","left":{"op":"fact","key":"principal.ageYears"},"right":{"op":"int","value":18}},{"op":"unmodeled"}]}]},"sources":["aliens-act-family","siri-accompanying-family"]},{"id":"partner","title":"Cohabiting partner over 18: SIRI asks, as a rule, for at least 1.5 to 2 years living together, so 2 years or more counts, and 1.5 to 2 years, or a registered partnership, is possible","path":["partner"],"condition":{"op":"all","operands":[{"op":"gte","left":{"op":"fact","key":"person.ageYears"},"right":{"op":"int","value":18}},{"op":"gte","left":{"op":"fact","key":"principal.ageYears"},"right":{"op":"int","value":18}},{"op":"any","operands":[{"op":"since","date":{"op":"fact","key":"edge.start"},"duration":"P2Y"},{"op":"unmodeled"}]}]},"sources":["aliens-act-family","siri-accompanying-family","guardianship-act-minors"]},{"id":"children","title":"Children under 18","path":["child"],"condition":{"op":"lt","left":{"op":"fact","key":"person.ageYears"},"right":{"op":"int","value":18}},"sources":["aliens-act-family","siri-accompanying-family","guardianship-act-minors"]}],"costs":[{"id":"application-fee","title":"Fee for the Pay Limit Scheme permit application: DKK 6,810, the amount set for 1 January to 31 December 2026","kind":"fee","amount":{"op":"money","amount":681000,"currency":"DKK"},"appliesTo":"principal","sources":["fee-order-principal","aliens-act-fee"]},{"id":"family-fee","title":"Fee for each accompanying family member''s permit application: DKK 3,080, the amount set for 1 January to 31 December 2026","kind":"fee","amount":{"op":"money","amount":308000,"currency":"DKK"},"appliesTo":"each_dependent","sources":["fee-order-family","aliens-act-fee"]}],"durations":[{"id":"processing","title":"SIRI''s processing of the application: normally 1 month, up to 3 months if further information is needed","min":"P1M","max":"P3M","sources":["siri-processing-and-duration"]},{"id":"permit","title":"Permit valid for the period of the employment; for an employment of 4 years or more, normally 4 years, then extended","min":"P0D","max":"P4Y","sources":["siri-processing-and-duration"]}],"corrects":1}'::jsonb, 'db79ca6a1fd7253390b8c69211d2258e296765971d952ceaacfbee34529ba162', '{"schemaVersion":1,"cases":[{"id":"brazilian-family-with-spouse-and-children","snapshot":{"recordedOn":"2026-10-01","members":["p1","p2","p3","p4","p5"],"people":[{"id":"p1","birthDate":"1985-03-10","recordedInFull":["spouses","partners","children","parents","assets"],"citizenships":[{"country":"BR","acquired":"1985-03-10","lost":"none","basis":"birth"}]},{"id":"p2","birthDate":"1987-08-20","recordedInFull":["spouses","partners","children","parents","assets"],"citizenships":[{"country":"BR","acquired":"1987-08-20","lost":"none","basis":"birth"}]},{"id":"p3","birthDate":"2015-05-05","recordedInFull":["spouses","partners","children","parents","assets"],"citizenships":[{"country":"BR","acquired":"2015-05-05","lost":"none","basis":"birth"}]},{"id":"p4","birthDate":"2008-09-30","recordedInFull":["spouses","partners","children","parents","assets"],"citizenships":[{"country":"BR","acquired":"2008-09-30","lost":"none","basis":"birth"}]},{"id":"p5","birthDate":"2012-01-15","recordedInFull":["spouses","partners","children","parents","assets"],"citizenships":[{"country":"US","acquired":"2012-01-15","lost":"none","basis":"birth"}]}],"relationships":[{"kind":"spouse","people":["p1","p2"],"start":"2012-06-01","end":"none"},{"kind":"parent","parent":"p1","child":"p3","parentKind":"biological"},{"kind":"parent","parent":"p2","child":"p3","parentKind":"biological"},{"kind":"parent","parent":"p1","child":"p4","parentKind":"biological"},{"kind":"parent","parent":"p2","child":"p5","parentKind":"biological"}],"assets":[]},"principal":"p1","rulesAsOf":"2026-10-01","expected":{"status":"needs_assessment","dependents":["p2","p3"],"possibleDependents":[],"missingFacts":[]}},{"id":"brazilian-and-italian-citizen-not-eligible","snapshot":{