-office-by-post","title":"An adult living abroad applies by post, at their own cost, with the documents in paper originals and proof of the fee, to a central office of the Foreign Ministry, no longer to a consulate","evidence":["principal.residenceCountry"],"sources":["dlgs-71-2011-central-office","legge-11-2026"]},{"id":"central-office-yearly-limit","title":"In 2029 and 2030 the central office takes, per year, no more applications than those for which consulates collected the fee in 2025, so an application needs a place in that number","evidence":["principal.residenceCountry"],"sources":["dlgs-71-2011-central-limit","legge-11-2026"]}],"dependents":[],"costs":[{"id":"central-office-fee","title":"An adult living abroad who applies to the Foreign Ministry''s central office: fee for handling the application; one of three paths, and only one fee is paid; the path is not recorded: possible","kind":"fee","amount":{"op":"money","amount":60000,"currency":"EUR"},"appliesTo":"principal","condition":{"op":"unmodeled"},"sources":["dlgs-71-2011-fee-table","legge-207-2024-consular-fee","dlgs-71-2011-central-office"]},{"id":"municipal-fee","title":"An adult who applies to a municipality in Italy: the municipality may charge up to this amount; one of three paths, and only one fee is paid; the path is not recorded: possible","kind":"fee","amount":{"op":"money","amount":60000,"currency":"EUR"},"appliesTo":"principal","condition":{"op":"unmodeled"},"sources":["legge-207-2024-municipal-fee"]},{"id":"court-fee","title":"A claimant who goes to court to have the citizenship established: fee for each claimant, even in a joint claim; one of three paths, and only one fee is paid; the path is not recorded: possible","kind":"fee","amount":{"op":"money","amount":60000,"currency":"EUR"},"appliesTo":"principal","condition":{"op":"unmodeled"},"sources":["dpr-115-2002"]}],"durations":[{"id":"recognition-decision","title":"Decision on an adult''s application sent to the central office of the Foreign