  ('pl-descent', 2, '{"schemaVersion":1,"routeId":"pl-descent","number":2,"corrects":1,"title":"Confirmation of Polish citizenship held from birth through a line of Polish parents","country":"PL","tags":["descent","citizenship"],"effectiveFrom":"2026-01-01","status":"open","currency":"PLN","sources":[{"id":"ustawa-2009-art-14","url":"https://dziennikustaw.gov.pl/DU/2025/1611","title":"Ustawa z dnia 2 kwietnia 2009 r. o obywatelstwie polskim (Dz.U. 2025 poz. 1611), in force since 15 August 2012, art. 14 pkt 1: a minor with at least one Polish parent is Polish by birth","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11","machineReadableUrl":"https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2025/1611/text.pdf"},{"id":"ustawa-2009-art-55","url":"https://dziennikustaw.gov.pl/DU/2025/1611","title":"Ustawa o obywatelstwie polskim of 2009, art. 55: the voivode decides, on application, whether a person holds Polish citizenship","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11","machineReadableUrl":"https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2025/1611/text.pdf"},{"id":"ustawa-1962-art-4","url":"https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/1962/49/text.pdf","title":"Ustawa z dnia 15 lutego 1962 r. o obywatelstwie polskim, in force from 21 August 1962, art. 4: a child of two Polish parents, or of one with the other unknown or of no or undetermined citizenship","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"ustawa-1962-art-6","url":"https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/1962/49/text.pdf","title":"Ustawa o obywatelstwie polskim of 1962, art. 6: with one foreign parent the child is Polish by birth, but the parents could choose the foreign citizenship within three months of the birth","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"ustawa-1951-art-6","url":"https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/1951/25/text.pdf","title":"Ustawa z 8 stycznia 1951 r. o obywatelstwie polskim, in force from 19 January 1951, art. 6: a child of two Polish parents, or of one with the other unknown or of unknown or undetermined citizenship","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"ustawa-1951-art-8","url":"https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/1951/25/text.pdf","title":"Ustawa o obywatelstwie polskim of 1951, art. 8: with one foreign parent, a child born in Poland is Polish unless the parents chose the foreign citizenship within a month of the birth","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"ustawa-1951-art-9","url":"https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/1951/25/text.pdf","title":"Ustawa o obywatelstwie polskim of 1951, art. 9: art. 8 reaches a child born abroad only if the other parent''s state applies the same rules to children born in Poland","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"ustawa-1920-art-5","url":"https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/1920/44/text.pdf","title":"Ustawa z dnia 20 stycznia 1920 r. o obywatelstwie Państwa Polskiego, in force from 31 January 1920, art. 5: a child born in wedlock takes the father''s citizenship, one born out of it the mother''s","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"ustawa-1920-art-11","url":"https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/1920/44/text.pdf","title":"Ustawa o obywatelstwie Państwa Polskiego of 1920, art. 11: citizenship is lost by acquiring a foreign one, or by taking public office or military service in a foreign state without consent","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"ustawa-1920-art-13","url":"https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/1920/44/text.pdf","title":"Ustawa o obywatelstwie Państwa Polskiego of 1920, art. 13: a grant or loss of citizenship reaches the wife and the children up to the age of 18","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"ustawa-2009-term","url":"https://dziennikustaw.gov.pl/DU/2025/1611","title":"Ustawa o obywatelstwie polskim of 2009, art. 10 ust. 3a: a confirmation case is settled within 6 months of the day the application reaches the authority that decides","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11","machineReadableUrl":"https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2025/1611/text.pdf"},{"id":"ustawa-2009-consul","url":"https://dziennikustaw.gov.pl/DU/2025/1611","title":"Ustawa o obywatelstwie polskim of 2009, art. 57: the application goes to the voivode; a person living outside Poland may file it through the consul of their place of residence","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11","machineReadableUrl":"https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2025/1611/text.pdf"},{"id":"ustawa-2025-921","url":"https://dziennikustaw.gov.pl/DU/2025/921","title":"Ustawa z dnia 25 czerwca 2025 r. o zmianie ustawy o repatriacji (Dz.U. 2025 poz. 921), in force from 1 August 2025: art. 2 sets the stamp duty at PLN 277 and art. 3 adds the 6-month term","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11","machineReadableUrl":"https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2025/921/text.pdf"},{"id":"oplata-skarbowa-item-27","url":"https://dziennikustaw.gov.pl/DU/2026/1395","title":"Ustawa z dnia 16 listopada 2006 r. o opłacie skarbowej (Dz.U. 2026 poz. 1395), annex, part I, item 27: PLN 277 for a decision confirming that a person holds or lost Polish citizenship","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11","machineReadableUrl":"https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2026/1395/text.pdf"},{"id":"oplata-skarbowa-art-3a","url":"https://dziennikustaw.gov.pl/DU/2026/1395","title":"Ustawa o opłacie skarbowej, art. 3a ust. 1: no stamp duty on an official act done on an application passed on through a Polish consul against a consular fee","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11","machineReadableUrl":"https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2026/1395/text.pdf"},{"id":"oplata-skarbowa-due","url":"https://dziennikustaw.gov.pl/DU/2026/1395","title":"Ustawa o opłacie skarbowej, art. 6 ust. 1 pkt 1 and ust. 2: the duty on an official act falls due, and is paid, when the application for it is filed","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-11","machineReadableUrl":"https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2026/1395/text.pdf"},{"id":"oplaty-konsularne-item-2-03","url":"https://dziennikustaw.gov.pl/DU/2026/1